  "title": "Ginger-Soy Baked Salmon",
  "description": "A fragrant marinade of ginger, soy, garlic, and a touch of spicy wasabi gives this baked salmon just the right amount of heat.",
  "authors": [
    "GODBLESSAVANESSA"
  ],
